{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1138","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1138","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1138\",\"parent_revision\":\"34d8c294e783011d240d9b053639c0934f8b154b\",\"root_revision\":\"620b17b7b617e3e56b26a1bffce8b0b724f75be8e2b3e014e79a0e43e46ca444\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDuring P964 (backlog-yaml-migration), T08 discovered remaining callers not covered by prior tasks. The only way to add T09 was to hand-edit the plan YAML directly. The MCP server then had a stale cache and couldn't find the new task via sam_read/sam_status.\\n\\nNeed a first-class `sam add-task` operation (both CLI and MCP tool) that:\\n- Appends a new task to an existing plan YAML atomically\\n- Accepts: plan address, title, agent, dependencies, priority, complexity, skills, context-notes\\n- Invalidates the MCP server's in-memory plan cache so the new task is immediately visible via sam_read/sam_status/sam_ready\\n- Optionally: re-invoke swarm-task-planner against the existing plan + new findings to extend/adapt the full task graph (e.g. \\\"given these divergence notes, what tasks are missing?\\\")\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **sam: add-task command to extend existing plans with new tasks** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: P964 implementation \u2014 T08 blocked by uncovered callers, required manual YAML edit + MCP server didn't pick up the new task\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-30\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"5dd48f02c6acf72928b69e7df1a14531e549ca0ffca4060773dd2266edba3f7c\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABXN9I4w\"}"}